# num_threads 0.1.7

A minimal library that determines the number of running threads for the current process.

- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/num_threads/0.1.7
- Repository: https://github.com/jhpratt/num_threads
- Documentation: https://docs.rs/num_threads/0.1.7
- License: MIT OR Apache-2.0

The package as published on crates.io carries no README. incan.pub wrote this one when it adopted the package as the Loaf `crates-io/num_threads`.
